<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-2092] Ignite does not recognize the right number of CPU cores when running under Docker</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-2092</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Run Ignite under a Docker container.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Limit Ignite from using all CPUs by way of Docker settings (which internally uses Linux CGROUPS). &lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Ignite will still report that all available CPUs are used ignoring Docker settings.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment></environment>
        <key id="12919660">IGNITE-2092</key>
            <summary>Ignite does not recognize the right number of CPU cores when running under Docker</summary>
